    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is54">
        <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e98">Caput 54</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1296D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_1@1-2">Lauda, sterilis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is54-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-is54-Nd1e112" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">Hactenus de nativitate, passione, resurrectione</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">tam de Judaeis quam de gentilibus congregatam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e123">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e125" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_1@1-2">Lauda, sterilis.</quote>
            Apostolus, juxta LXX: <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e128" source="http://scta.info/resource/gal4_27@4-18">Laetare, sterilis, quae non paris, erumpe et clama quae non parturis, quia multi filii desertae</quote>, etc. Nos autem fratres secundum Isaac, repromissionis filii sumus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e133">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e135">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e137">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e139" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_3@1-3">Ad dexteram enim:</quote>
            ad omnia loca mundi. Vel, nec elata prosperis, nec fracta adversis. Vel, ad bona futurae et praesentis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e144">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e146">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_4@1-2">Noli timere.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is54-Rd1e153"><name xml:id="gom-is54-Nd1e154" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e157"><seg type="qs">Cum turris Babel aedificaretur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui funiculu.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e166">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e168">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e170">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e172" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_6@1-3">Quia ut mulierem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is54-Rd1e175"><name xml:id="gom-is54-Nd1e176" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e179"><seg type="qs">Qui sequuntur <pb ed="#P" n="1297A"/> tropologiam et in locis difficillimis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">stolam osculumque porrigit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e191">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e193">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e195">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e197" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_9@1-4">Sicut in diebus Noe,</quote>
            etc. Ut credat sanctorum congregatio misericordiam Domini sempiternam, et ad punctum esse desertos, ut amici Dei foedere aeterno fiant: majorum ponit exempla.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e204">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_14@5-6">Recede procul.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is54-Rd1e211"><name xml:id="gom-is54-Nd1e212" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e215">Consolatus est Ecclesiam de gentibus, promittens eis spirituales gratias: nunc docet quid agat, ne adversarios timeat.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e219">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e221">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e223">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e225" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_15@1-2">Ecce accola.</quote>
            Hoc ad se invertunt Judaei, tanquam sint futuri proselyti ex gentibus tempore Christi sui.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e230">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e232">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e234">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e236" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_16@1-2">Ecce ego.</quote>
            Non quod sim causa perditionis eorum, sed adversarius pugnans, victis perditionis, victoribus causa est praemii.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is54-Dd1e241">
          <head xml:id="gom-is54-Hd1e243">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is54-d1e245">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1297B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is54-Qd1e249" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is54_17@18-19">Haec est haereditas.</quote>
            Ne justus tribuatus deficiat, addit praemia.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
